Export workflow
The export step creates eight 10 m integer unit_id rasters: the four seed spacings for each of the two sites. All are saved as separate GEE assets.
Asset root:
projects/thicket-ecological-condition/assets/BII_SA/
Asset naming:










Site
600 m
